---
description: >-
  Two named/id'd edges (an association and an include relationship) with a
  classDef, an inline style statement, and per-edge `animation`/`animate`
  overrides applied via the `@{...}` edge-property syntax.
---
usecase-beta
    direction LR

    actor Customer

    Checkout
    Payment
    Customer opens@-- "starts checkout" ---> Checkout
    Checkout payment@..> : include Payment

    classDef emphasized stroke:#d33,stroke-width:3px
    class opens,payment emphasized

    style opens stroke:#06c,stroke-width:4px
    opens@{ animation: fast }
    payment@{ animate: false }
